issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### What happened?\n\nThe commit https://github.com/goreleaser/goreleaser/commit/013bd69126459125694d7cb2c434dd9ba63e5a5b breaks https://github.com/caddyserver/caddy goreleaser's flow. One of the steps in the `before.hooks` is to create the directory to be used as the build dir later on. The referenced commit validates the `go version` before running any of the `before.hooks`, but it also tries to switch into the build dir before it's created because it doesn't get created until the `before.hook` runs.\n\n### How can we reproduce this?\n\nHave the `builds.dir` specified to a directory which gets created as part of the `before.hooks`, then run `goreleaser check` or `build` or `release`. The run will fail before running any of the before hooks.\r\n\r\nCaddy's `.goreleaser.yml` file:\r\nhttps://github.com/caddyserver/caddy/blob/84b906a248a7cf7299f39f2f997822cb38387759/.goreleaser.yml#L1-L25\r\n\r\nFailing run:\r\nhttps://github.com/caddyserver/caddy/runs/3424377795?check_suite_focus=true#step:3:24\r\n\n\n### goreleaser version\n\n```bash\ngoreleaser version 0.176.0\r\ncommit: dd5ccf7170741e0303e90e81faf9073d03ac8f43\r\nbuilt at: 2021-08-24T23:49:11Z\r\nbuilt by: goreleaser\r\nmodule version: v0.176.0, checksum: h1:z3hvWAsJCTWS2fmfpbhWYEtIZuxWiwDcq22R2KUZcV8=\n```\n\n\n### GoReleaser Check\n\n- [X] goreleaser check shows no errors\n\n### Search\n\n- [X] I did search for other open and closed issues before opening this.\n\n### Code of Conduct\n\n- [X] I agree to follow this project's Code of Conduct\n\n### Additional context\n\nThe workaround (for us) is to create the directory before invoking goreleaser. This isn't nice because the task ends up being duplicated across 2 flows: `goreleaser check` in our lint run, and the plain `goreleaser` release flow.\r\n\r\nAbout the `goreleaser check shows no errors`, although I checked that box, the issue is with the command itself failing prematurely.","closed_by":{"login":"caarlos0","id":245435,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTQzNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245435?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0","html_url":"https://github.com/caarlos0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/2434/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/2434/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}